     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hey folk,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m running a common factor GWAS and I am getting this error for one of the SNPs that is causing the program to crash:</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-kerning:auto;font-feature-settings:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">Error in solve.default(t(S2.delt) %*% S2.W %*% S2.delt, tol = toler) :<span> </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-kerning:auto;font-feature-settings:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><span>  </span>system is computationally singular: reciprocal condition number = 1.4036e-34</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-kerning:auto;font-feature-settings:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-kerning:auto;font-feature-settings:normal;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal\">I&#39;ve run CF GWAS several times for various models and this is the first time I&#39;ve come across this issue. </p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-kerning:auto;font-feature-settings:normal;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-kerning:auto;font-feature-settings:normal;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal\">To me the easiest solution would be just to skip these SNPs. I&#39;m curious if other Users have seen this error. Any suggestions from the authors?<br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-kerning:auto;font-feature-settings:normal;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-kerning:auto;font-feature-settings:normal;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-kerning:auto;font-feature-settings:normal;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal\">Hasuni</p></div></div>\r\n"
